{"id":"prisio_n","lemma":"prisión","pos":"noun","rank":736,"glosses":["prison (a place or institution of confinement, especially of long-term confinement for those convicted of serious crimes or otherwise considered undesirable by the government)"],"ipa":"/pɾiˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"prisiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-prisi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él está en prisión.","en":"He's in prison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77753"},{"text":"Estoy en la prisión.","en":"I'm at the prison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443488"},{"text":"Tom murió en prisión.","en":"Tom died in prison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799501"},{"text":"Lo metieron en prisión.","en":"He was put in prison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453041"},{"text":"Fue condenado a prisión.","en":"He was sentenced to prison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/826082"}]}